        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Freebuff CLI release 0.2.20",
        "summary": "Freebuff CLI version 0.2.20 publishes updates including refined session error messaging and a new deterministic compaction mode. The CLI now parses the server message for session_superseded errors to distinguish between refunded model starts, closed hours, and concurrent instance takeovers, showing specific recovery hints for the first two cases. Additionally, a user cohort selected by fnv1a hash now runs mechanical context compaction instead of model-based handoffs, controlled by DETERMINISTIC_COMPACTION_PERCENT in the compaction policy.",
