        "evidence": "The commit bumps the version in freebuff/cli/release/package.json from 0.2.19 to 0.2.20. Release member source evidence shows cli/src/hooks/helpers/send-message.ts updating error handling for session_superseded to distinguish refunded starts from takeovers, and common/src/constants/compaction-policy.ts adding deterministic compaction for a user cohort.",
