        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff 0.2.20 refines how error messages appear when your free session ends unexpectedly, now distinguishing between a refunded start, a closed session hour, and a takeover by another instance. For the 10% of users in an experimental group, context compaction now uses a mechanical rewrite of history instead of a model handoff, skipping the AI summary step entirely. The release cleans up the agent definitions by removing the \"fast\" mode and related validation options from the base orchestrator, simplifying how tasks are planned and executed. Additionally, sponsored ad data tracking was updated to include detailed failure reasons and execution details, ensuring privacy-safe diagnostics are stored for analytics without exposing user files or credentials.",
